    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm not sure I follow. What do you mean by \"gobblers\"? And why are you bringing up goblins in a chemistry discussion? I just need to know about the electrostatic repulsion and the charge stability of the phospholipids.",
      "source": "evaluator"
